  m_Name: Cube_Material.003_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Exhaust Manifold
  description: The Exhaust Manifold is a small, elongated component located at the
    top-center-front of the engine, tasked with collecting exhaust gases from the
    cylinders and directing them towards the exhaust system. Made of Material.003,
    its compact size and strategic location allow it to efficiently collect and expel
    exhaust gases. Notably, the Exhaust Manifold's design and material help to reduce
    backpressure and minimize heat transfer to surrounding components.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d754ac7ab0d271b458687633b7625293, type: 3}
